{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body>\n<p>Tahrir App 讓你直接在相片上書寫文字，內建超過 150 種字體、背景與顏色，亦可加入自己收藏的字體，適合製作宣傳圖、社交貼文或簡報配圖的用戶。原價 US $0.99，現正限時免費。</p>\n<img alt=\"限時免費\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/460x460Icon-Ap-SiOS01-75-53.webp\">\n<h2>文字排版更自由的加字工具</h2>\n<p>Tahrir App 通用於 iPhone 與 iPad，相片以可編輯文件形式儲存，方便日後重複修改，並支援復原與重做。內建超過 150 種字體，可經同一 WiFi 網絡的電腦網頁工具加入或移除自訂字體，並按語言排序、隱藏多餘字體。對齊工具能把文字對齊畫面中央或其他文字邊緣，另可加上陰影、底線、外框與刪除線效果，介面簡潔，讓你專注於設計。</p>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1242x2688bb-460-scaled.jpg\">\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1242x2688bb-461-scaled.jpg\">\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1242x2688bb-462-scaled.jpg\">\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1242x2688bb-463-scaled.jpg\">\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1242x2688bb-464-scaled.jpg\">\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1242x2688bb-465-scaled.jpg\">\n<ul>\n<li>應用名稱：Tahrir App – Text on image.</li>\n<li>應用類別：Photo &amp; Video</li>\n<li>下載位置：App Store</li>\n</ul>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-23T20:44:22.225932+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":346,"images":7,"source":"New MobileLife","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-23T20:36:52+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-24T05:18:39.495726+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-23T20:38:28.336915+00:00","content_hash":"d3e1012591260e71dd213b69e99aa4f87f9013bebf0c4f6dd2edba9b36c2c0df","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}